{
  "version": "0.1.2",
  "slug": "target-bar",
  "title": "Target bar",
  "group": "Charts",
  "order": 6.5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A horizontal bar for progress toward a goal: the fill is where you are, a marker shows where you should be (the goal, or today's pace), and an optional tint ahead of the fill shows the forecast. Words above say the value against the goal.",
    "id": "Batang horizontal untuk kemajuan menuju target: isian menunjukkan posisi sekarang, penanda menunjukkan posisi yang seharusnya (target, atau laju hari ini), dan tint opsional di depan isian menunjukkan prakiraan. Kata-kata di atasnya menyebut nilai terhadap target."
  },
  "titleId": "Target bar",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Quarter goal with a forecast",
        "desc": "The fill is the income so far, the tint is where the trend ends the quarter, the marker is the goal. Fills grow in on first view.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\" data-lds-grow aria-labelledby=\"tb-q\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"tb-q\">Will we reach the Q4 target?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Local tax income since 1 October</div></div>\n  <div class=\"target\" style=\"--v: 84.3%; --t: 100%; --f: 97%;\">\n    <div class=\"target__meta\"><span class=\"target__label\">Local tax</span><span class=\"target__val\"><b>Rp 84.3 bn</b> of Rp 100 bn</span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__track\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Local tax: Rp 84.3 bn of Rp 100 bn, goal marked at 100 percent, forecast 97 percent\"><span class=\"target__forecast\"></span><span class=\"target__fill\"></span><span class=\"target__mark is-end\"><span class=\"target__mark-label\">Goal</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__foot\"><span>Forecast Rp 97 bn by 31 Dec</span><span>45 days left</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Marker at today's pace",
        "desc": "Each goal's marker sits where the team should be today. Behind pace turns the fill to warning, and the words say so.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\" aria-labelledby=\"tb-pace\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"tb-pace\">Which puskesmas are on plan?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Vaccine doses given this week against each puskesmas plan</div></div>\n  <div class=\"target-list\" data-lds-grow>\n  <div class=\"target target--success\" style=\"--v: 87.5%; --t: 62%;\">\n    <div class=\"target__meta\"><span class=\"target__label\">Puskesmas Kedaton</span><span class=\"target__val\"><b>175</b> of 200 doses</span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__track\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Puskesmas Kedaton: 175 of 200 doses, goal marked at 62 percent\"><span class=\"target__fill\"></span><span class=\"target__mark\"><span class=\"target__mark-label\">Today</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__foot\"><span>Ahead of plan</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"target target--warning\" style=\"--v: 33%; --t: 62%;\">\n    <div class=\"target__meta\"><span class=\"target__label\">Puskesmas Panjang</span><span class=\"target__val\"><b>60</b> of 180 doses</span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__track\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Puskesmas Panjang: 60 of 180 doses, goal marked at 62 percent\"><span class=\"target__fill\"></span><span class=\"target__mark\"><span class=\"target__mark-label\">Today</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__foot\"><span>52 doses behind plan</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"target\" style=\"--v: 60%; --t: 62%;\">\n    <div class=\"target__meta\"><span class=\"target__label\">Puskesmas Way Halim</span><span class=\"target__val\"><b>90</b> of 150 doses</span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__track\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Puskesmas Way Halim: 90 of 150 doses, goal marked at 62 percent\"><span class=\"target__fill\"></span><span class=\"target__mark\"><span class=\"target__mark-label\">Today</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__foot\"><span>On plan</span></div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Target triwulan dengan prakiraan",
        "desc": "Isian adalah penerimaan sejauh ini, tint adalah posisi akhir triwulan menurut tren, penanda adalah targetnya. Isian tumbuh saat pertama terlihat.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\" data-lds-grow aria-labelledby=\"tb-q\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"tb-q\">Apakah target triwulan IV tercapai?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Penerimaan pajak daerah sejak 1 Oktober</div></div>\n  <div class=\"target\" style=\"--v: 84.3%; --t: 100%; --f: 97%;\">\n    <div class=\"target__meta\"><span class=\"target__label\">Pajak daerah</span><span class=\"target__val\"><b>Rp 84,3 M</b> dari Rp 100 M</span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__track\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Pajak daerah: Rp 84,3 M dari Rp 100 M, target ditandai di 100 persen, prakiraan 97 persen\"><span class=\"target__forecast\"></span><span class=\"target__fill\"></span><span class=\"target__mark is-end\"><span class=\"target__mark-label\">Target</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__foot\"><span>Prakiraan Rp 97 M pada 31 Des</span><span>45 hari lagi</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Penanda di laju hari ini",
        "desc": "Penanda setiap target berada di posisi yang seharusnya dicapai tim hari ini. Jika tertinggal, isian berubah menjadi peringatan, dan kata-katanya menyebutkannya.",
        "html": "<section class=\"chart-card\" style=\"max-width: 520px;\" aria-labelledby=\"tb-pace\">\n  <div><div class=\"chart-card__q\" id=\"tb-pace\">Puskesmas mana yang sesuai rencana?</div><div class=\"chart-card__sub\">Dosis vaksin yang diberikan minggu ini terhadap rencana tiap puskesmas</div></div>\n  <div class=\"target-list\" data-lds-grow>\n  <div class=\"target target--success\" style=\"--v: 87.5%; --t: 62%;\">\n    <div class=\"target__meta\"><span class=\"target__label\">Puskesmas Kedaton</span><span class=\"target__val\"><b>175</b> dari 200 dosis</span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__track\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Puskesmas Kedaton: 175 dari 200 dosis, target ditandai di 62 persen\"><span class=\"target__fill\"></span><span class=\"target__mark\"><span class=\"target__mark-label\">Hari ini</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__foot\"><span>Di depan rencana</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"target target--warning\" style=\"--v: 33%; --t: 62%;\">\n    <div class=\"target__meta\"><span class=\"target__label\">Puskesmas Panjang</span><span class=\"target__val\"><b>60</b> dari 180 dosis</span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__track\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Puskesmas Panjang: 60 dari 180 dosis, target ditandai di 62 persen\"><span class=\"target__fill\"></span><span class=\"target__mark\"><span class=\"target__mark-label\">Hari ini</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__foot\"><span>52 dosis di belakang rencana</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"target\" style=\"--v: 60%; --t: 62%;\">\n    <div class=\"target__meta\"><span class=\"target__label\">Puskesmas Way Halim</span><span class=\"target__val\"><b>90</b> dari 150 dosis</span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__track\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Puskesmas Way Halim: 90 dari 150 dosis, target ditandai di 62 persen\"><span class=\"target__fill\"></span><span class=\"target__mark\"><span class=\"target__mark-label\">Hari ini</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"target__foot\"><span>Sesuai rencana</span></div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
      }
    ]
  },
